  "evidence": "TEXT_F: 5,000 extra police each year, elected police commissioners, 20,000 extra prison places and ending early release; 24/7 port surveillance, a British Border Control Police, an Australian-style points system, processing asylum outside the UK, and an annual immigration limit set by Parliament; restoring school discipline (heads control admissions/expulsions, Turnaround Schools) and protecting teachers; lower, simpler taxes to reward work and enterprise with funding following pupils/patients; increased defence spending with NATO at the core, opposition to the EU Constitution, and backing the Union. TEXT_D: repeal control-order law, prosecute terror in mainstream courts, scrap ID cards, curb PM powers and introduce STV/devolution; 10,000 extra police and completion of 20,000 CSOs with community payback; allow asylum seekers to work, faster asylum via a dedicated agency, create a UK Border Force, support the EU Constitution and prepare to join the euro; free personal care, abolish tuition fees, restore maintenance grants, Single Equality Act, and stronger mental health rights.",
